0:{"buildId":"4jyhtURzJjykZZcsuxfCv","rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-100 via-purple-50 to-blue-100","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-8","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/blog","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-600 hover:text-pink-600 transition-colors mb-6","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left w-4 h-4","children":[["$","path","1l729n",{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"}],["$","path","x3x0zl",{"d":"M19 12H5"}],"$undefined"]}],"返回列表"]}],["$","header",null,{"className":"mb-8","children":["$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"w-full h-40 md:h-48 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-400 via-rose-400 to-red-400 mb-6 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"text-center px-6","children":["$undefined",["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white text-center px-6 drop-shadow-md","children":"冷战熬成福尔摩斯？不如按这三步拆弹"}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-400","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"2026年8月11日"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-1","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-clock w-4 h-4","children":[["$","circle","1mglay",{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"}],["$","polyline","68esgv",{"points":"12 6 12 12 16 14"}],"$undefined"]}],2," 分钟阅读"]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"bg-pink-50 text-pink-500 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs","children":"恋爱技巧"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"relative bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm mb-8","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"spread":40,"glow":false,"disabled":false,"proximity":64,"inactiveZone":0.01,"borderWidth":3,"variant":"pink"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"relative prose prose-pink max-w-none","children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 ","children":"有没有发现，冷战比吵架累一万倍？\n俩人在同一个屋檐下，你刷马桶他擦桌子，空气静得能听见蚊子打呼噜，你一边扒拉手机一边偷瞟：他怎么还不说话？他是不是不爱我了？我忍不住先开口会不会输？\n演到最后，你都能自己脑补出80集家庭伦理剧，人家其实只是在想晚上吃啥。"}],["$","p","1",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 ","children":"别死撑着当冷战冠军了，分享三个没人教过的实用小技巧，亲测好用不丢面："}],["$","p","2",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 bg-pink-50 p-4 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-pink-400","children":"第一招，别搞情绪试探，搞“物理需求”破冰。别发“你是不是还生气”逼对方表态，直接说“我点奶茶，你喝少糖还是全糖”，或者拽拽他袖子说“我够不到柜子顶的零食”，给对方一个台阶，也给自己一个出口——毕竟没有啥矛盾是一顿喝的解决不了，不行就再加一份炸串。"}],["$","p","3",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 bg-pink-50 p-4 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-pink-400","children":"第二招，不说“你总是冷暴力”，说“我有点难受”。很多人破冰第一句就是“你能不能别冷暴力我”，一下子又把对方推到对立面。换成软话反而管用：“半天没跟我说话，我心里空落落的，刚才想了半天，其实我刚才也不对。”先摆感受再认错，比指责有用一百倍。"}],["$","p","4",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 bg-pink-50 p-4 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-pink-400","children":"第三招，定好冷战止损规则。提前跟对象说好，不管吵成啥样，冷战不许超过12小时，谁先超时谁承包一周家务。有规矩在，就不会拖着拖着把感情拖凉。"}],["$","p","5",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 ","children":"其实冷战哪是为了分对错，不过是想看看自己在对方心里到底重不重要。与其互相熬着，不如主动伸手，毕竟赢了冷战，输了爱人，亏死了。"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"relative bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm mb-8","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"spread":40,"glow":false,"disabled":false,"proximity":64,"inactiveZone":0.01,"borderWidth":3,"variant":"pink"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"relative flex items-center justify-between","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-3","children":[["$","button",null,{"className":"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-pink-100 flex items-center justify-center text-pink-500 hover:bg-pink-200 transition-colors","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://